      *################################################################*00010000
      *                                                                 00020000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00030000
      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R115IHI0.                                             00050000
      *                                                                 00060000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_History.          00070000
      *                                                                 00080000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00090000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00100000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00110000
      *                                                                 00120000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180000
      *                                                                 00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00210000
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R115IHI0-Transaction     00230000
      *    Set   R115IHI0-Version        To    True                     00240000
      *    Set   R115IHI0-In-Get-1st     To    True                     00250000
      *                                                                 00260000
      * One of these:                                                   00270000
      * 1) Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IHI0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00280000
      * 2) Move  &fin-inst-no            To    R115IHI0-In-Fin-Inst-No  00290000
      *                                                                 00300000
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IHI0-In-Contract-Type00310000
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IHI0-In-Contract-No  00320000
      *                                                                 00330000
      *    Move  &currency (ISO 4217)    To    R115IHI0-In-CA-Currency  00340000
      *    Move  &part-amount seq.no     To    R115IHI0-In-PA-Seq-No    00350000
      *                                                                 00360000
      *    Call  'F115ITR0'              Using R115IHI0-History         00390000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00400000
      *    End-Call                                                     00410000
      *                                                                 00420000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00430000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00440000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00450000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00460000
      *                                                                 00470000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00480000
      *        ...not found...                                          00490000
      *                                                                 00500000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00510000
      *        ...found...                                              00520000
      *                                                                 00530000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00540000
      *                                                                 00550000
      *################################################################*00560000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00570000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00580000
      *010300!LG ! New copy area                                 !LG10! 00590000
      *################################################################*00600000
      *                                                                 00610000
         03  R115IHI0-History.                                          00620000
      *                                                                 00630000
           05  R115IHI0-Version-No              Pic  X(08).             00640000
             88  R115IHI0-Version                    Value '20000103'.  00650000
      *                                                                 00660000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00670000
      *                                                                 00680000
           05  R115IHI0-Qualification.                                  00690000
      *                                                                 00700000
             10  R115IHI0-In-Action             Pic  X(16).             00710000
               88  R115IHI0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00720000
               88  R115IHI0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00730000
               88  R115IHI0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00750000
               88  R115IHI0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00770000
      *                                                                 00780000
      * There are several key-fields, which may be used differently     00790000
      * depending on the need.                                          00800000
      *                                                                 00810000
      * In-Table must be set whatever the desired action is.            00820000
      *                                                                 00830000
      * For Insert, use the Data area for all fields.                   00840000
      *                                                                 00850000
      * For and Delete, use:                                            00860000
      *     - Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                                00870000
      *     - Contract-Type                                             00880000
      *     - Contract-No                                               00890000
      *     - Currency                                                  00900000
      *     - Part Amount Sequence Number                               00910000
      *     - EH Sequence Number                                        00910100
      *                                                                 00930000
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), use:                           00940000
      *     - Optional: Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                      00950000
      *     - Optional: Contract-Type                                   00960000
      *             or: Contract-Type with mask (e.g. 'I* ')            00970000
      *     - Optional: From-Contr-No and To-Contr-No                   00980000
      *     - Optional: Currency and Part Amount Seq.no                 00990000
      *     - Optional: Transaction Seq.no                              01000000
      *                                                                 01010000
             10  R115IHI0-In-Key.                                       01020000
      *                                                                 01030000
      *        It is optional wether you use Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID.01040000
               15  R115IHI0-In-Fin-Inst.                                01050000
                 20  R115IHI0-In-Fin-Inst-No    Pic  X(18).             01060000
                 20  R115IHI0-In-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01070000
      *                                                                 01080000
      *        Contract-Type and -No is mandatory for                   01090000
      *        Select/Update/Delete.                                    01100000
               15  R115IHI0-In-Contract.                                01110000
                 20  R115IHI0-In-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).             01120000
                 20  R115IHI0-In-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01130000
      *                                                                 01140000
                 20  R115IHI0-In-From-Contr-No  Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01150000
                 20  R115IHI0-In-To-Contr-No    Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01160000
      *                                                                 01170000
      *        These fields are both mandatory for                      01180000
      *        Delete.                                                  01190000
               15  R115IHI0-In-Part-Amount.                             01200000
                 20  R115IHI0-In-CA-Currency    Pic  X(03).             01210000
                 20  R115IHI0-In-PA-Seq-No      Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01220000
      *                                                                 01230000
               15  R115IHI0-In-HI-Seq-No        Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01240000
      *                                                                 01250000
      * When performing a Get-1st-call one may ask for the total        01260000
      * number of rows complying with the qualification.                01270000
      *                                                                 01280000
             10  R115IHI0-In-Code-Count         Pic  X(10).             01290000
               88  R115IHI0-In-CC-Count              Value 'COUNT'.     01300000
      *                                                                 01310000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01320000
      *                                                                 01330000
           05  R115IHI0-Data.                                           01340000
      *                                                                 01350000
             10  R115IHI0-Key.                                          01360000
               15  R115IHI0-Fin-Inst-ID         Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01370000
               15  R115IHI0-Contract-ID.                                01380000
                 20  R115IHI0-Contract-Type     Pic  X(03).             01390000
                 20  R115IHI0-Contract-No       Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01400000
      *                                                                 01410000
               15  R115IHI0-Part-Amount.                                01420000
                 20  R115IHI0-CA-Currency       Pic  X(03).             01430000
                 20  R115IHI0-PA-Seq-No         Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01440000
      *                                                                 01450000
               15  R115IHI0-HI-Seq-No           Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01460000
      *                                                                 01470000
             10  R115IHI0-Operation-Type        Pic  X(20).             01480001
      *                                                                 01510000
             10  R115IHI0-User-Id               Pic  X(07).             01520003
             10  R115IHI0-Timestamp             Pic  X(26).             01530000
      *                                                                 01540000
             10  R115IHI0-Text-Length           Pic s9(4)        Comp.  01540100
      *                                                                 01540206
             10  R115IHI0-Text                  Pic x(150).             01540300
      *                                                                 01540406
             10  Filler REDEFINES  R115IHI0-Text.                       01540504
                 15  R115IHI0-Agent-Text        Pic X(24).              01540612
