                         'Avregnet agentprovisjon:'.                    01540811
                 15  Filler                     Pic X(01).              01540904
                 15  R115HI0-Agent-Am-Use       Pic 9(14)V9(03).        01541009
                 15  R115HI0-Agent-Am-Display   Pic ZZZZZZ.ZZZ.ZZ9,999-.01541110
                 15  R115HI0-Agent-Currency     Pic X(03).              01542007
