      * Don't change this redefine                                      01720214
             10  Filler REDEFINES  R115IHI0-Text.                       01720313
                 15  R115IHI0-SilentC-Text        Pic X(27).            01720413
                  88 R115HI0-Silent-C-On Value                          01720513
                         'Silent Confirmation valgt'.                   01720613
                  88 R115HI0-Silent-C-Off Value                         01720713
                         'Silent Confirmation fjernet'.                 01720813
                 15  Filler                     Pic X(123).             01721213
      *                                                                 01721313
             10  Filler.                                                01721413
               15  R115IHI0-Fin-Inst-No         Pic  X(18).             01722002
      *                                                                 01723002
      * The following accumulators are only relevant when performing    01730000
      * Get-1st or Get-Next.                                            01740000
      * Row-No starts on 1 when doing Get-1st, and increases by 1 for   01750000
      * each Get-Next.                                                  01760000
      * Total-Rows is set when doing Get-1st, but ONLY if the           01770000
      * In-CC-Count is set. The field will tell you how many rows       01780000
      * that complies with your qualification.                          01790000
      *                                                                 01800000
             10  R115IHI0-Out-Accumulators.                             01810000
               15  R115IHI0-Out-Row-No          Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01820000
               15  R115IHI0-Out-Total-Rows      Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01830000
